      "message": "you can drop the \\t\n\nAlso, add a comment here saying that we use call to push errorcode, eip, cs, and eflags on the stack so we have access to it to print a debug warning.\n\nAlso how do we know that this is a far call instead of a near call? It looks like they push different things on the stack.",
